  "contract": "LIMIT_WARRANT",
  "subject": "A complete history does not prove accurate recall.",
  "verdict": "SATISFIED",
  "unresolved_conditions": [],
  "rationale": "S005 distinguishes documentary completeness from the truth of recorded content. Where recollection contributes evidence, fully documenting a recollection does not independently verify its accuracy: even sincere recall can be mistaken. This warrants the stated limitation without asserting that any actual recall error occurred.",
